ntence_id":3,"text":" The OS X version of the game was released on 22 February 2011 by Feral Interactive.","title":"Lego Harry Potter: Years 1–4"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" The game was released for the PlayStation 4 on October 21, 2016, as part of the "Lego Harry Potter Collection", which bundles the game with its sequel, "".","title":"Lego Harry Potter: Years 1–4"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Harry Potter and the Order of the Phoenix
